seg-d1a967a443ea = Score a bounded NMEA { "0183" } excerpt (at most { "2" } MiB and { "20,000" } epochs; it must hold the calibration window) the way <c1/> scores it: per-epoch trust state and 0-100 score with the monitors that deducted, a summary and the last <c2/>. The bounded form of the live command: no socket is opened and nothing is written to a port; the gate, <c3/> and the telemetry exporters (Prometheus, OTLP, syslog) are command-line only. Advisory only; MODELLED. See <a1><c4/></a1>.

