seg-89e894d4b416 = A vessel's NMEA { "0183" } log (at most { "4" } MiB) as a batch run, with the session TOML stating the vessel's limits: the score model and every epoch's 0-100 score with its deductions (the reply keeps counts by state and the first { "200" } degraded or untrusted epochs). Advisory only; MODELLED.

