seg-27698c80b7f1 = Read the published Jammertest test catalogue and transmission plan (NPRA/jammertest-plan, MIT) as scheduled truth (<c1/>): one test area's slots become receiver-trust events with the catalogue id and year in each label. Planned slots, not recorded on-air times; no contact field of the plan is read. MODELLED. See <a1><c2/></a1>.

