seg-1da73ad326de = Acquire, then track with the DLL/PLL/FLL (delay-, phase- and frequency-locked loop) bank (<c1/>), with the loops from a <c2/> TOML file in the work directory (<c3/>) or the built-in design, and optional re-acquisition (<c4/>): per channel, epochs, final Doppler, final and mean C/N0, phase- and code-lock fractions, locked at the end, the final lock state, false locks and re-acquisitions, plus the design's name and hash. Tracking streams in bounded memory; per-epoch output goes to files only (<c5/>: E/P/L, discriminators, loop states, C/N0, lock state as .csv/.jsonl/.bin; <c6/>).

